{"ID":"20240118151203-5v231eg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151203-5v231eg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151203-5v231eg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151204-el29aob\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240131101354-wmycvbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240131101354-wmycvbi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"149凝水石","type":"doc","updated":"20240131101354"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151204-el29aob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151204-el29aob","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);","updated":"20240122115943"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛寒，主身热腹中积聚邪气，皮中如火烧，烦满水饮之，久服不饥，又名寒水石。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115948-3d8yhqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115948-3d8yhqs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生于卤地积盐之下，精液渗入土中，年久至泉，结而成石，清莹如水晶，亦有带黑色者。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115950-elqiujh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115950-elqiujh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛亦做咸，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115951-v0o4rt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115951-v0o4rt2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】凝水石主明目固齿凉血降火，时气热盛，腹中积聚，疗汤火伤（烧研敷）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115953-ewinlrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115953-ewinlrj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】除时气热盛，五脏伏热，胃中热，止渴，水肿，小腹痹。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115955-bij5qk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115955-bij5qk6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】压丹石毒风，解伤寒劳复。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115957-dr5qqn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115957-dr5qqn3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通煎剂一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115958-gq9qfxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115958-gq9qfxq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性寒，虚寒之体不宜，入肾走血，除热之功与诸盐同，畏地榆，解丹石巴豆毒，制丹砂，伏玄精石。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122115944-x2fwj1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122115944-x2fwj1j"}},{"ID":"20240122120000-gg50krg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122120000-gg50krg"}},{"ID":"20240122120000-waau6o0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122120000-waau6o0","updated":"20240131101112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一百四十九，这个凝水石呢，味道是辛寒的，它过去是生在盐地，卤盐的那个地，那个盐田下面，它那个盐，泡在地上面，泡着，一直渗，渗下去，津液都渗到泥土里面，年深日久以后哦，它渗到地下的泉水里面去，这个时候你去挖起来以后，看起来就像水晶一样，哇，一块块，白白的石头，这就是凝水石，它味道是辛辣的，同时有咸味。"}]},{"ID":"20240122121846-it361qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122121846-it361qq","updated":"20240131101242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"看[别录]说，这个凝水石呢，止渴，水肿，我们一般吃的海盐，青盐，岩盐，这种天然的盐，都有排水的功能，就是我们的人工盐不排水，所以你到那个工厂提的精炼盐，都不排水，越吃水肿越厉害，最烂的盐，就是我们在美国在餐厅里面桌子上吃的那种盐最烂，那是全世界最烂的，他们美国人吃盐的时候，吃个牛排，盐洒很多啊，不是洒两三下，洒满满的啊，然后开始吃，都被骗嘛，因为广告，一些说明是假的，所以吃那个盐，啊我需要这个，这里面有什么什么钙呀，什么钠呀，什么成分在里面，我需要这个，对我身体好，越吃下半身水肿的越大，根本是骗人的，所以有时候，我跟老外已经不用讲了，为什么啊，我一站起来，我就赢了，已经赢了嘛，那你还要跟我讲什么啊，你跟我讲什么没有用，你看看我们俩的身材就知道了。"}]},{"ID":"20240122121854-erumnb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122121854-erumnb5","updated":"20240131101347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种盐块呢，诸位吃的时候可以大剂量，你可以用到两三钱，那味道很咸。我们用得不多，因为止渴，我们利水，水肿，我们有很多的药，那这个我用得不多，诸位可以试用，因为，我用得不多的原因是，太咸了，吞不下去，咸的东西啊，诸位到海水里面，哪天到海边去啊，海水你吞一口看看，海水是催吐的，保证你吐啊，呵呵，很咸，所以太咸了有时候吞不下去，但这个咸跟我们一般的中药的咸，我们在攻坚的那个咸不一样，我们攻坚的咸，病人可以吞下去，但这种咸，太咸的话，像卤水一样，恶心啊，好像喝肥皂水一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240131101354-wmycvbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240131101354-wmycvbi"}}]}